From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sunshineinabox <aqemail@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 02:00:00 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] clk: qcom: dispcc-sm6115: fix the MDSS GDSC settings and
 enable runtime PM

The SM6115 MDSS GDSC sits at the same register as the QCM2290 one
(0x5f03000 in both vendor trees), and gets the fixes Qualcomm made for
QCM2290 in v7.3:

 08cfbfd81dd6 clk: qcom: qcm2290: Update DISPCC and GPUCC GDSC *wait_val values
 6b0044bc75b0 clk: qcom: qcm2290: Set POLL_CFG_GDSCR flag for DISPCC and GPUCC GDSCs
 899dfd90229e clk: qcom: qcm2290: Add RETAIN_FF_ENABLE flag for DISPCC and GPUCC GDSCs
 11345cbf17ca clk: qcom: dispcc-qcm2290: Enable runtime PM support

Wait values: the hardware defaults, 0x2/0x2/0xf. Without them gdsc.c
writes its own defaults (EN_FEW 0x8, CLK_DIS 0x2), which per the QCM2290
commit can stall the GDSC state machine. The vendor bengal kernel never
writes these fields, so it runs on the hardware defaults too.
POLL_CFG_GDSCR: the GDSCR status bit may not show the real state.
RETAIN_FF_ENABLE: register context is kept across GDSC collapse.
use_rpm: the DT now puts DISPCC on VDD_CX (our 1173); with runtime PM its
vote is dropped when no display clock is in use instead of held for good.

Not posted. Not HW-tested.

Signed-off-by: sunshineinabox <aqemail@gmail.com>
---
 drivers/clk/qcom/dispcc-sm6115.c | 6 +++++-
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/clk/qcom/dispcc-sm6115.c b/drivers/clk/qcom/dispcc-sm6115.c
index 4abe2bd9aea3..79ac03d27275 100644
--- a/drivers/clk/qcom/dispcc-sm6115.c
+++ b/drivers/clk/qcom/dispcc-sm6115.c
@@ -520,11 +520,14 @@ static const struct qcom_reset_map disp_cc_sm6115_resets[] = {
 
 static struct gdsc mdss_gdsc = {
 	.gdscr = 0x3000,
+	.en_rest_wait_val = 0x2,
+	.en_few_wait_val = 0x2,
+	.clk_dis_wait_val = 0xf,
 	.pd = {
 		.name = "mdss_gdsc",
 	},
 	.pwrsts = PWRSTS_OFF_ON,
-	.flags = HW_CTRL,
+	.flags = HW_CTRL | POLL_CFG_GDSCR | RETAIN_FF_ENABLE,
 };
 
 static struct gdsc *disp_cc_sm6115_gdscs[] = {
@@ -572,6 +575,7 @@ static const struct qcom_cc_desc disp_cc_sm6115_desc = {
 	.num_resets = ARRAY_SIZE(disp_cc_sm6115_resets),
 	.gdscs = disp_cc_sm6115_gdscs,
 	.num_gdscs = ARRAY_SIZE(disp_cc_sm6115_gdscs),
+	.use_rpm = true,
 };
 
 static const struct of_device_id disp_cc_sm6115_match_table[] = {
-- 
